OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over proposed sex shop
OL,4,Anext to domestic abuse centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns have been raised about
OL,7,Fproposals to open a sex shop next to a
OL,8,Fsupport centre for victims and
OL,9,Fsurvivors of sexual violence,
OL,10,Fexploitation and domestic abuse.
OL,12,FEve Goodman, 40, applied for a licence
OL,13,Fto run Swon, on Singleton Street,
OL,14,FSwansea, after being made redundant
OL,15,Ffrom the sex shop where she previously
OL,16,Fworked.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
