OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns over proposed sex shop
OL,4,Anext to domestic abuse centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a council licensing meeting on
OL,7,FTuesday, it emerged that the name of
OL,8,Fone of the support initiatives operated
OL,9,Fby One Stop Shop - the Swan Project,
OL,10,Faimed at women at risk of sexual
OL,11,Fexploitation - was almost identical to
OL,12,FSwon and could potentially lead to
OL,13,Fmisunderstanding.
OL,15,FThe council said it would issue a
OL,16,Fdecision on the licence within five
OL,17,Fworking days.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
